# The main menu in play, SaveAnywhere: ON (fixtures/snapcfg: the CD's
# LBA.CFG with the key): a new game, its text and movie cut, a walk in
# the cell. Escape opens the main menu over the game, and its Options
# Menu the options, which Return to previous menu leaves. Escape on the
# main menu goes on with the game. S and the list's New Game line name
# a save abc. A walk, then F8 and Return on abc save over it. A walk,
# then Escape, Save Game and Return on abc save over it again, and
# Resume Game goes on. A walk, then Escape, Load Game and abc: the scene
# as at the last save.

